    "date": "2026-11-10",
    "engine": "Unreal Engine 5.8",
    "source_commit": "98f0004 (origin/master, includes 8623124 'Settings: KEY BINDINGS reference') re-read 2026-11-10 from a fresh read-only clone; PR #1 (claude/todo-list, 5f2c656) does not touch input or settings code",
    "how_read": "IMC_IronMan + 20 UInputAction objects (IA_Move, IA_Look, IA_Ascend, IA_Descend, IA_ToggleFlight, IA_Fire, IA_Special, IA_Hulkbuster, IA_Pause, IA_ToggleView, IA_SuitWheel, IA_WheelPage, IA_Boost, IA_Vent, IA_Ally, IA_QuickSlot1..5) are created at runtime with NewObject in AIronManCharacter::CreateDefaultInputIfNeeded (IronManCharacter.cpp L639-739) and bound in SetupPlayerInputComponent (L741-793). Everything else is polled: SuitSuperComponent::TickInput (RMB/LMB/LT/R3/H/B/R), AIronManCharacter::TickAimFeel (Left Alt), UCareerInput::TickInteract/TickVehicle/TickKeys (E, U, K, N, M, O, vehicle keys), widget NativeOnKeyDown (UCareerScreen, UMainMenuWidget, USettingsWidget, UStoryMenuWidget, USuitSelectWidget), AArenaPlayerController (F11 / Alt+Enter). There are no .uasset input actions / mapping contexts and Config/DefaultInput.ini has no action or axis mappings (only mouse capture + F11/Alt+Enter flags).",
    "rebindable": "Only the four UCareerInput::Key() names read [IronManArena.Keys] from GameUserSettings.ini then DefaultGame.ini: SuitExit, Faceplate, WebSwing, WebZip. Everything else is hard-coded (IMC built in C++).",
    "validated_by": "Tools/vison_menu/gen_controls_table.py --check (every kbm_keys / pad_keys name must appear as EKeys::<Name> in the cited source file)",
    "generated_cpp": "ControlsReference.inl (gen_controls_table.py) -> Source/IronManArena/Private/Generated/ControlsReference.inl"
  },
